        "original_id": "3a3c8f39-db3d-5849-8b96-20b38f5e03dd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Special Operations Command, Jaeger Corps, Frogman Corps, Danish Defence, Royal Danish Army\n- Places: Aalborg Air Base\n- Concepts: special operations forces, command structure\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Special Operations Command in Denmark was established to unite the Jaeger Corps and the Frogman Corps under one command.\n- Special Operations Command in Denmark is based at Aalborg Air Base.\n- The Jaeger Corps, also known as Jægerkorpset, is an elite special operations force of the Danish Defence.\n- The Jaeger Corps is part of Special Operations Command.\n- The Jaeger Corps was formerly part of the Royal Danish Army.\n- The Jaeger Corps is based at Aalborg Air Base.",
